## SQ-ABD-01 | 
@group B
@commands Boot, then `/dumpall` and look up `abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_perch_slice` and `.../cooked_pike_slice`
@pass Both gone; `creativedelight:smelting/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice` and `.../cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice` present, experience 0.35, cookingtime 200, same input and output; the smoking and campfire recipes (`creativedelight:smoking/...`, `creativedelight:campfirecooking/..._from_..._slice`) present; no error in `logs/latest.log`
@fails Depends on: CD jar. Recipe ids renamed `smelting/cooked_<fish>_slice_from_<fish>_slice` (recipes/all.csv 2026-11-19; r1120nv batch fault)
@jars creativedelight
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> cdevtest recipes abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_
> cdevtest rdetail cooked_perch_slice
> cdevtest rdetail cooked_pike_slice
expect verb=recipes text=abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_ n=0\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smelting/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice serializer=minecraft:smelting\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smelting/cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice serializer=minecraft:smelting\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smoking/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice serializer=minecraft:smoking\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:campfirecooking/cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice serializer=minecraft:campfire_cooking\b
look experience 0.35 and cookingtime 200 are not printed (part=fields only for public fields): check the /dumpall recipe dump; the smoking and campfire lines unchanged
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

## SQ-ABD-04 | pickerelweed tag and the two CD cooking recipes
@group B
@commands Same boot; `/dumptags` or the tag dump
@pass `#creativedelight:pickerelweed` = blue + purple (tag moved from `creativeengineering:`, ids follow the owning mod; tag dump 2026-11-19); `abnormals_delight:pickerelweed_juice` and `pike_with_beetroot` gone; `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pickerelweed_juice` and `.../pike_with_beetroot` take that tag twice, 1.0 xp, 200 ticks
@fails Depends on: CD jar
@jars creativedelight
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:pickerelweed
> cdevtest rdetail pickerelweed_juice
> cdevtest rdetail pike_with_beetroot
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:pickerelweed n=2 ids=\S*upgrade_aquatic:blue_pickerelweed
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:pickerelweed n=2 ids=\S*upgrade_aquatic:purple_pickerelweed
reject verb=rdetail id=abnormals_delight:\S*pickerelweed_juice serializer=
reject verb=rdetail id=abnormals_delight:\S*pike_with_beetroot serializer=
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pickerelweed_juice(_manual_only)? serializer=\S+ result=\S+ ingredients=\S*pickerelweed\S*pickerelweed
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pike_with_beetroot serializer=\S+ result=\S+ ingredients=\S*pickerelweed\S*pickerelweed
look 1.0 xp and 200 ticks: a part=fields line shows them only if the recipe class has public fields (else recipe dump or JEI)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

## SQ-VTDA-10 | wild ghost peppers: only the crimson nylium one survives a neighbor update
@group B
@commands Terralith world: `/setblock` wild ghost peppers on grass, moss, mycelium, crimson nylium; update a neighbour
@pass Only the nylium one survives
@fails Vintage `GhostPepperWildCropBlock.java` (`mayPlaceOn`); TODO `ports/vintageport #7` (with SQ-VTD6-01)
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1103/sA_4.qb
# own home (r1120fix, 2026-11-20): {SBH} came from the retired r1103 setup row SA4-00; rows run alone with --rows
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sbhome] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["sbhome"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sbhome,limit=1] Pos
capture SBH entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {SBH1+16} {SBH3-8} {SBH1+31} {SBH3+8}
sleep 3
> setblock {SBH1+20} 200 {SBH3} minecraft:grass_block
> setblock {SBH1+22} 200 {SBH3} minecraft:moss_block
> setblock {SBH1+24} 200 {SBH3} minecraft:mycelium
> setblock {SBH1+26} 200 {SBH3} minecraft:crimson_nylium
> setblock {SBH1+20} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers
> setblock {SBH1+22} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers
> setblock {SBH1+24} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers
> setblock {SBH1+26} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers
sleep 1
> setblock {SBH1+20} 201 {SBH3+1} minecraft:stone
> setblock {SBH1+22} 201 {SBH3+1} minecraft:stone
> setblock {SBH1+24} 201 {SBH3+1} minecraft:stone
> setblock {SBH1+26} 201 {SBH3+1} minecraft:stone
> fill {SBH1+20} 201 {SBH3+1} {SBH1+26} 201 {SBH3+1} minecraft:air
sleep 2
> execute if block {SBH1+20} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers run say SA4 pepper grass survived
> execute if block {SBH1+22} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers run say SA4 pepper moss survived
> execute if block {SBH1+24} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers run say SA4 pepper mycelium survived
> execute if block {SBH1+26} 201 {SBH3} vintagedelight:wild_ghost_peppers run say SA4 pepper nylium survived
expect SA4 pepper nylium survived
reject SA4 pepper (grass|moss|mycelium) survived
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|Invalid (block state|tag)|That position is not loaded)
